# Corrected version (added in task 2.1.3, committed before it runs) of 245, whose
# source omitted n from the capture list (E10405); the original stays with its observed outcome.
# WS2-09. spec/06 §6.1 L-6: returning a capturing closure is E10404.
profiles: host
with: tok.clo
expect: reject E10404
contrast: return [n] () => n + 1; ==> return () => 4;
contrast-expect: output
--- contrast-output
4
